---
config:
  theme: base

  themeVariables:
    primaryColor: "#334155"
    primaryBorderColor: "#64748b"
    primaryTextColor: "#0f172a"

    actorBkg: "#1e293b"
    actorBorder: "#475569"
    actorTextColor: "#f8fafc"

    secondaryColor: "#2563eb"
    secondaryBorderColor: "#3b82f6"
    secondaryTextColor: "#0f172a"

    tertiaryColor: "#e2e8f0"
    tertiaryBorderColor: "#94a3b8"
    tertiaryTextColor: "#0f172a"

    lineColor: "#64748b"
    signalColor: "#475569"

    noteBkgColor: "#f8fafc"
    noteBorderColor: "#94a3b8"
    noteTextColor: "#111827"

    labelTextColor: "#0f172a"

    fontFamily: "Inter, Segoe UI, Arial"
    fontSize: "16px"

  sequence:
    actorMargin: 80
    messageMargin: 45
    noteMargin: 20
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Student as Authenticated Student
    participant VoteAPI as Voting Controller
    participant DB as Database

    Student->>VoteAPI: POST /api/v1/votes (SeasonID, CandidateID) [JWT Auth Token]
    VoteAPI->>VoteAPI: Extract UserID from Auth Token
    VoteAPI->>DB: Check if User Has Already Voted in this Season
    
    alt Duplicate Vote Attempt
        DB-->>VoteAPI: Record Exists
        VoteAPI-->>Student: 409 Conflict ("You have already voted in this season")
    else First-Time Vote
        VoteAPI->>DB: Insert Vote Record (SeasonID, UserID, CandidateID)
        DB-->>VoteAPI: Success
        VoteAPI-->>Student: 200 OK ("Vote successfully cast")
    end